<title>CANADA: Petro-Canada boosts 1997 capital spending.</title>
<headline>Petro-Canada boosts 1997 capital spending.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petro-Canada said on Thursday it had increased its planned 1997 capital spending by C$200 million to C$1.15 billion, with funding to come from higher than expected cash flow.</p>
<p>Petro-Canada said the increased spending would be directed to oil exploration and development off the east coast of Canada and natural gas exploration, development and acquisition in western Canada.</p>
</text>
